      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most \"18+\" lobbies are Friends+ or Invite+ for this very reason. Even if you do implement a date of birth system into the game, they'll simply lie about their age. If people want to quit VRChat for other VR titles for whatever reason, that's their prerogative",
