      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2f6f47cb5f2349c1873556|full_name}: Just simply responding to what you said about the date of birth system. If they lie, the person who lied about their age has far less of a valid claim about seeing/hearing things they were not meant to in the first place. There are situation where it could be something else but for the majority of things, vrchat and the other players in the instance would not be completely responsible in those situations.\nIf we are allowed to identify an instance as an 18+ lobby or no filming lobby etc, then the TOS could be a bit more friendly to those that are already trying to implement their own for safety of breaching TOS due to the many underage kids on the platform. This included those that basically only do so in non-public instances as you mentioned.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
