  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-21T13:42:58.019Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be VERY useful to get an 18+ option, when creating a new public instance like a checkbox or something that prevents users under 18 years from joining. Ofc for this it is needed that everyone adds their day of birth in registration or a popup window after the next update. This would prevent those 9 year olds from continuing to destroy our VRChat experience. Right now it is impossible to find a good public instance without huge amounts of squeekers or 15 year old respectless teen boys. This is the reason why on a DAILY scale more and mores longtime users QUIT VRChat and move to NeosVR or ChilloutVR and this trend will continue If no actions are taken. Of course an argument  against this would be \"just block them or mute them dude\", but If we are honest to ourselfs... Who wanna hangout in a lobby with 10 blocked users or do this everytime when changing worlds? Right! No one.",
